cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GAPA, please cite the paper below."
title: "GAPA: Gender Associations of Physical Attributes"
abstract: >-
  A dataset of 315 common physical attributes paired with 14,706 gender-association
  ratings from 304 US-based annotators, plus code for evaluating 22 LLMs against those
  human ratings and a trained proxy predictor.
